        self.red_left = self.black_left = 12
        self.red_kings = self.black_kings = 0
        self.create_board()
    # ... rest of the code remains the same
```

This should resolve the `NameError` by ensuring the `Piece` class is properly imported before it's used in the `create_board()` method.

